  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Refactor HttpModel to generic HttpModel<T>\n      - Extract HTTP-building APIs into a generic subclass and expose internals for reuse.\n      - Private fields (body, positions, lengths, flags) were made internal so the generic HttpModel<T> can implement Clone, SetBegin, SetHeader/AddHeader, SetBody and related builder helpers without duplicating logic.\n      - The non-generic HttpModel had its long fluent-building members removed and Clear() simplified; per-type models (RequestModel, ResponseModel) now inherit from HttpModel<T> and provide type-specific Clear/fluency.\n      - Unit tests updated to use TestHttpModel : HttpModel<T> and adjusted Clone calls and Clear usage. Intent: reduce code duplication, enable strongly-typed fluent builders, and centralize clone/build logic while keeping existing behavior.",
